The algorithm is:
```
stack = []
count = 0
for j from len(position)-1 down to 0:
    while stack and speed[j] >= stack[-1]:
        stack.pop()
    if stack:
        # Robot j can merge with stack[-1]
        pass
    else:
        count += 1
        stack.append(j)
return count
```

Time complexity: O(n), where n is the number of robots. Space complexity: O(n).

